# UI minimal copy

**Default:** do not add UI text unless the user asks or it is **really needed**.

## Allowed

- Form field labels (WCAG)
- Primary actions (`Save`, `Cancel`)
- Errors / validation
- Destructive confirms (one short line)
- `aria-label` on icon-only controls

## Do not add unless asked

- Page subtitles under a clear title
- Helper paragraphs, tip callouts
- Empty-state essays
- Marketing microcopy on operational screens

When text _is_ required, follow **`human-copy.mdc`**.
